      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### \ud83e\udded [Triage Hub](/d/ids-master-hub-ultimate?var-device=${device}) | **\ud83d\udcca DNS & ML Diagnostics** | [\ud83d\udd12 Network & Lateral (Zeek NDR)](/d/ids-tier2-ndr?var-device=${device}) | [\ud83c\udf0d GeoIP & OSINT Intel](/d/ids-tier2-geo?var-device=${device}) | [\u2699\ufe0f Engine System Health](/d/ids-system-health)"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "\ud83d\udcd6 Novice Analyst Guide: Machine Learning & Behavioral Outliers",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### \ud83e\udd16 Machine Learning & Sequential Transition Diagnostics\n* **IsolationForest (ML Outlier):** Evaluates multi-dimensional feature vectors. Scores > 0.02 indicate statistically unusual network activity.\n* **Markov Sequence Transitions:** Measures probability of phase transitions (`NORMAL` $\\rightarrow$ `RECON` $\\rightarrow$ `C2` $\\rightarrow$ `EXFIL`). Scores > 0.90 alert on forced kill-chain advancement.\n* **Risk Velocity Z-Score:** Measures how rapidly a device's risk score is accelerating relative to its historical baseline."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ML Anomaly Score (IsolationForest)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dfm29b4en3im8e"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "home_ids_ml_anomaly_score{hostname=~\"$device\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{hostname}} (ML Outlier)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
