        "content": "### \ud83d\udcca Dynamic Diurnal Baselines & Z-Score Anomaly Matrix\n* **Dynamic Query Threshold:** Displays live query rate against historical moving average (`mean`) and upper limit threshold (`mean + 3\u03c3`). Exceeding upper limit indicates DNS flooding or rapid beaconing.\n* **Statistical Z-Scores:** Tracks standard deviations ($Z > 3.0$) for Query Rate, Entropy, and Unique Domains."
