        "content": "### \ud83d\udea8 DGA Botnets, Tunneling & Block-Evasion Spikes\n* **New Domains & Algorithmic DGA:** Simultaneous spikes in New Domains and Suspicious DGA counts indicate botnet domain generation algorithms.\n* **NXDOMAIN & Blocked Ratios:** Unbound NXDOMAIN failures ($>0.40$) and Blocked Ratio Z-scores ($>3.0$) indicate malware trying to evade Pi-hole blocking or scan dead C2 servers."
